{"sha": "8f75219b5ed607b7d4f30b34c12d14b612846390c01f980f45adb63d39e10635", "body": ["{\\small 糖在溶解：条纹从方糖上升。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g2-muddy-jar.jpg}", "", "{\\small 泥土不溶解：它沉在底部。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.35]", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {beaker={0.7}{omWater!70}};", "  \\fill[brown!55] (4.2,0) rectangle (5.8,0.22);", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (5,0) {beaker={0.7}{brown!12}};", "  \\fill[brown!55] (4.2,0) rectangle (5.8,0.22);", "  \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.7pt] (4.2,0.22) -- (4.2,0) -- (5.8,0) -- (5.8,0.22);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\y in {4.4/0.32,4.75/0.45,5.1/0.3,5.5/0.5,4.6/0.7,5.3/0.8,4.9/1.0}", "    \\fill[brown!60] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.025);", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-0.15)", "    {\\textbf{糖}放入水中搅拌：\\\\ 澄清，底部什么也没有};", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (5,-0.15)", "    {\\textbf{沙子}放入水中搅拌：\\\\ 浑浊，底部有一层};", "  \\draw[<-, omProp, thick] (6.0,0.11) -- (7.0,0.11)", "    node[right, text=black] {沙子};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small \\cref{met:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:test}的检验：糖", "溶解，沙子不溶解。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{溶解的物质仍在水中}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[溶解的固体仍在水中]\\label{prop:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:still-there}", "固体溶解时并没有消失，而是散布在", "整杯水中，碎粒小得肉眼看不见。有两条线索说明它仍在", "水中：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 甜茶尝起来是甜的，海水尝起来是咸的；", "  \\item 水干了以后，固体会留下来。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{remark}[实验室里不尝味道]\\label{rem:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:no-tasting}", "茶是甜的，是因为茶是食物。在实验室里，没有人", "会尝任何东西，哪怕是看起来像水的液体：", "第二条线索，让水蒸干，才是化学家所用的方法。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[来自海水的盐]\\label{ex:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:salt-pans}", "在一些阳光充足的海岸，海水被引入宽而浅的池塘。日复", "一日，阳光把水晒干。留在池底的", "白色盐粒被耙成一堆一堆，正是溶解在", "海水中的盐。餐桌上的盐常常来自这样的池塘。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=1.25]", "  % day 1: a saucer of salty water", "  \\fill[omWater!80] (0,0.18) ellipse (1.25 and 0.22);", "  \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.7pt] (-1.5,0.3) .. controls (-1.2,-0.15) and (1.2,-0.15) .. (1.5,0.3);", "  \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.5pt] (0,0.3) ellipse (1.5 and 0.28);", "  \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-0.35) {一碟\\\\ 咸水};", "  % the sun", "  \\fill[ocYellow] (3.4,1.45) circle (0.28);", "  \\foreach \\a in {0,45,...,315}", "    \\draw[ocYellow!90!orange, thick] ($(3.4,1.45)+(\\a:0.36)$) -- ($(3.4,1.45)+(\\a:0.52)$);", "  \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (2.0,0.3) -- (4.8,0.3)", "    node[midway, below, text=black, align=center] {几个晴天\\\\ 之后};", "  % later: a white crust", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.3cm]", "    \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.7pt] (-1.5,0.3) .. controls (-1.2,-0.15) and (1.2,-0.15) .. (1.5,0.3);", "    \\draw[omGlass, line width=0.5pt] (0,0.3) ellipse (1.5 and 0.28);", "    \\foreach \\x/\\y in {-0.9/0.12,-0.6/0.2,-0.3/0.08,0/0.18,0.3/0.1,0.6/0.2,0.9/0.12,", "                       -0.45/0.28,0.15/0.27,0.75/0.3,-0.75/0.31}", "      \\fill[white, draw=black!45, line width=0.2pt] (\\x,\\y) rectangle ++(0.11,0.07);", "    \\node[align=center, anchor=north] at (0,-0.35) {水已蒸干：\\\\ 白色盐};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 水干了，溶解在其中的盐", "留了下来。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.62\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g2-salt-pans.jpg}", "", "{\\small 海边的盐池：阳光晒干海水，盐", "留成一堆堆白色的盐。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[溶解不是熔化]\\label{rem:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:not-melting}", "人们常说糖在茶里“熔化”。其实不是：熔化是", "冰块在阳光下自己变成液体的过程，", "不需要水。糖在茶里则需要水，而糖", "仍在水中，只是散开了。正确的说法是\\emph{溶解}。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:1}", "下列哪些固体能溶解在水中，哪些不能？糖、", "沙子、盐、粉笔、鹅卵石。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:2}", "什么是溶液？请举出本章中的两个例子。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:mixing-and-dissolving:3}", "一碗麦片算不算一种混合？你还能看清它的每个组成部分吗？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}